The registry-first sample tests/registry/si.jsonl contains addresses, postcodes and coordinates
from the Register of Addresses (Register naslovov) of the Surveying and Mapping Authority of the
Republic of Slovenia (Geodetska uprava Republike Slovenije, GURS), export "Register naslovov za
območje Slovenije" (file RN_SLO_NASLOVI_20261025.zip, database state of 2026-10-25), downloaded
from the Javni geodetski podatki application on 2026-10-29. Source: Geodetska uprava Republike
Slovenije, Register naslovov, 25. 10. 2026 (https://podatki.gov.si/dataset/register-naslovov,
https://ipi.eprostor.gov.si/jgp/data). Used under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), per GURS's general terms
for the use of geodetic data (https://www.e-prostor.gov.si/fileadmin/struktura/General_terms.docx).
Statistical region names are from GURS's Register of Spatial Units (Register prostorskih enot),
same date and licence.
Changes: coordinates converted from D96/TM (EPSG:3794) to WGS84; queries were constructed from the
register's fields, not by GURS. Per-case file checksums and retrieval dates are recorded in the
corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/si.md records the upstream checksums.
